    "description": "The Telecom SIM Replacement API facilitates the batch processing of SIM card replacements for telecom providers. By using this API, businesses can efficiently manage and replace multiple SIM cards in a single operation, streamlining the workflow for customer service teams. Typical consumers of this API include telecom operators and customer support applications that need to handle SIM replacement requests at scale. This API enhances operational efficiency, reduces manual effort, and improves customer satisfaction through timely service delivery.",
